 not the sum of reported outcomes, so an uncollected claim fails closed instead of reading as silence. CONTROLS: none yet; the repro is the four-copy probe above plus the copy of the declaration with its quote-escape literal recomposed, both deleted before the push of #16270, so the row carries the repro in words. CEILING: the count check is mechanically preventable inside gunbc; the token-grain skip that desynchronises is a parser-boundary matter. NEXT TRIGGER: the claim lane counts declared claims per entry and refuses on any mismatch with reported outcomes, rather than trusting a tally of what arrived.",
